drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='The Lakeview Hotel\, one of the\ntop-rated hotels in the area\, is\nnow offering a two-day\, one-night\nconference package for businesses.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,644.200\,652.624)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='湖景酒店是該地區最受好評的酒店之一，現為企業\n提供兩天一晚的會議套餐。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,644.200\,652.624)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='The package includes accommodation\nfor one night\, use of our fully\nequipped conference rooms\, and a\ncomplimentary breakfast and dinner\nfor each guest.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,653.024\,661.928)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='套餐包括一晚住宿、使用我們設備齊全的會議室以\n及每位客人的免費早餐和晚餐。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,653.024\,661.928)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='It also includes access to all of\nthe hotel\'s facilities\, such as\nthe sauna\, swimming pool\, and golf\ncourse. Wi-fi is provided for free\nthroughout the hotel.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,662.328\,673.176)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='還可以使用飯店的所有設施，如桑拿浴室、游泳池\n和高爾夫球場。飯店各處提供免費無線上網。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,662.328\,673.176)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='Our conference rooms are perfect\nfor any business meeting.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,673.576\,677.440)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='我們的會議室非常適合舉辦任何商務會議。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,673.576\,677.440)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='Provided equipment includes five\nwireless microphones\, one\nprojector and screen\, and two\nlaser pointers.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,677.840\,685.328)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='提供的設備包括五個無線麥克風、一台投影機和螢\n幕以及兩個雷射筆。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,677.840\,685.328)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='We have rooms for any size of\nmeeting\, with a seating capacity\nof 15\, 30\, 50\, or 100.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,685.728\,693.024)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='我們擁有適合各種規模會議的會議室，可容納\n15、30、50 或 100 人。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,685.728\,693.024)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='This offer is only available to\ngroups of 15 or more and only from\nMonday to Friday\, and is not valid\non weekends or holidays.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,693.424\,701.608)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='此優惠僅適用於 15\n人或以上的團體，且僅限週一至週五，週末或假日無效。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=472:enable='between(t\,693.424\,701.608)',
drawtext=font='Microsoft JhengHei':text='Additional equipment can be\nprovided\, for a fee. Conference\nrooms will open thirty minutes\nbefore the scheduled start time to\nallow guests to set up.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=108:enable='between(t\,702.008\,711.656)',
